}


void VO_marks_commandfinordlong( entity ent )
{
 //Markswell: Command is finalizing our orders as we speak, the long and short of it is that we aren't going in with the Nexus assault.  They've got something else planned for us, Sci-Tech has uncovered something critical inside the Strogg data, and until that information is fully decoded, we are in a holding pattern.    
